{"unit_id":"147-sys__dsh-memory-rules#feature-01","repo":"147-sys/dsh-memory-rules","commit":"099d3f08705eee69460cca9fba26d5eabd433595","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-rules 的功能「跨会话事实记忆」：在回合结束时提取对话事实并写入本地存储，支持世界知识和经历两类。由会话结束事件触发，事实同时可镜像到按日 Markdown 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.js:518-526","lib/tools.js:74-81"]}
{"unit_id":"147-sys__dsh-memory-rules#feature-02","repo":"147-sys/dsh-memory-rules","commit":"099d3f08705eee69460cca9fba26d5eabd433595","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-rules 的功能「四路记忆检索」：按语义草图、关键词、关系图和时间线查找并合并结果。每轮首步自动注入相关记忆，也可通过 memory_retrieve 工具提交自然语言查询。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.js:583-610","lib/tools.js:152-185"]}
{"unit_id":"147-sys__dsh-memory-rules#feature-03","repo":"147-sys/dsh-memory-rules","commit":"099d3f08705eee69460cca9fba26d5eabd433595","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-rules 的功能「信念整理」：定期将同主题事实归并为信念，并记录加强或结论修订；原始事实保留为证据。可由后台日程运行，也能通过 memory_reflect 手动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/reflect.js:1-20","lib/tools.js:264-300"]}
{"unit_id":"147-sys__dsh-memory-rules#feature-04","repo":"147-sys/dsh-memory-rules","commit":"099d3f08705eee69460cca9fba26d5eabd433595","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-rules 的功能「提示词规则编辑」：在 Web UI 中管理有序提示词块，Host 将启用内容放入 memory-rules 系统提示词上下文。用户可查看信念库并编辑提示词，不需修改源码。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1590-1595","lib/plugin.js:430-438"]}
